  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Kusa awaken to their inner potential early in their training, gaining a pool of ki points, supernatural energy she can use to accomplish amazing feats. The number of points in a kusa’s ki pool is equal to 1/2 her kusa level + her Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p>The ki pool is replenished each morning after 8 hours of rest or meditation; these hours do not need to be consecutive.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kusa#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
